{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1746736368_1155360_194472a2536ddb982f4a5bd359ba2569.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"318\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"86\">• Brand introduction:</strong><br data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"89\">Takashima Shop is a curated online destination focused on sourcing the latest and most complete selection of Japanese beauty and lifestyle products. We bring high-quality, trend-forward items straight from Japan to your doorstep.</p><p data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"560\"><strong data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"346\">• Product description:</strong><br data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"349\">Our offerings include foundations, sunscreens, skincare, lip products, makeup removers, and beauty tools. We cater to fans of natural, glowy makeup looks and daily beauty routines inspired by Japanese standards.</p><p data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"799\"><strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"595\">• USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"598\">✔ Ships across the U.S.<br data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"624\">✔ Weekly new arrivals, synchronized with Japan<br data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"673\">✔ Monthly promotions and gift-with-purchase campaigns<br data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"729\">✔ Exclusive “choose one of two” gift events with qualified purchases</p><p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"935\"><strong data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"821\">• Payment terms:</strong><br data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"824\">Affiliates receive 10% commission per completed order. Commissions are tracked and can be withdrawn via PayPal.</p><p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1087\"><strong data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"961\">• Other information:</strong><br data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"964\">Perfect for beauty influencers and J-beauty enthusiasts. Join us in promoting a simple yet elevated daily beauty lifestyle.</p></div></div>",
